  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Any Devs looking at this stop doing the two factor verification none likes downloading apps to access there account follow by a timed code and the recovery codes sometimes just don't work\n\nQuestion: why can't we use the emails we literally use to login you also can send codes to the emails so why this goofy thing? \n\nQuestion 2: this doesn't affect users or new users and visitors only known users and trusted users why is that the case because all of the accounts i have lost is known or trusted \n\nNot only that sometimes people don't have pc or use them for work so they would get a trusted friend to upload the avatars for them this makes it harder for those who need to do that \n\nI understand that this is put in place to keep things safe but getting locked out of an account you spent hours on making friends on makes don't seem safe to alot of people\n\nNow two factor can be good for some people but give a choice if they want it or not because this can so easily go wrong \n\nAnyway thanks for taking the time to read this and I hope that this can help vr chat be easier to use for people",
